    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sister_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「ガキんちょども、なかなか満足してくれないんだもん！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「バレーのルールもぜんぜん覚えないから、なぜか最終的にドッヂボールになってたし！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「ううっ、全身が痛い！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「ばんばんボールぶつけられたし、怪我したとこかばって変な動きしてたせいで関節痛～！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-sister",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sister_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「でも、みんな楽しそうだったわね。そうよ、バレーは楽しいのよっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「これで、ガキんちょどもが『バレーは楽しい』って思ってくれたら……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「もしかしたらガキんちょども、将来、君咲学院に入るかもしれないし！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「それで、バレー部に入るかもしれないし！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-sister",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sister_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「君咲学院バレー部の悲願である、全国大会優勝を成し遂げるかもしれないわ……！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-sister",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sister_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「そうよ、あたしは未来のバレー部に貢献したのよ！　ふふ～ん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
